{"author":{"id":"a3a282966ced55effb4560271fcd98e13241af24ea76b00ec76a0f18154bc8ee"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1790618831,"nonce":"YO/FH+niB+h39iMy1RtYkcX5ds4=","message":"Revised 2026-09-28 (Luis), from using show on the tracker:\n\n- Enter is the one action key. It does what the thing under the cursor is for: opens the issue on the id column, follows a link, edits any other cell (a bool flips at once), presses a button, and is a newline in the comment box. C-Enter and F2 are gone. C-Enter only exists on terminals with the kitty keyboard protocol; everywhere else the terminal sends the same byte as Enter, so one key did two things on two machines. F2 was the fallback, and a function key is not where a hand is.\n- Show is header, fields, comment box, tabs. The header is the three built-ins as cells: type (dim, left of the title as the list has it), title (bold, no colour, over a dim rule), archived (warning colour when true; drawn only under the cursor, as \"archive\", when not). Left/right walk the cells; Enter on type lists the schema's types, on title opens an input, on archived toggles. The three are no longer rows of the fields table.\n- The box is one stop with an inside. Its buttons are a footer line inside the block, reached with Down from the text's last line; Enter presses; Up returns to the text; Up from the first line leaves for the fields. Tab skips the block whole. The cursor still opens in the text. Sending is Down, Enter on every terminal.\n- Back from the first view parks the cursor on the call line, which unfolds into the whole `git work view \u003ckind\u003e '{...}'` command, wrapped; C-c copies it; back from there quits; Enter/Tab/directions return to the view, any other key returns and then means what it means there. It replaces the \"back again to quit\" warning: the place the second back quits from is worth standing on. Not editable yet.\n- The mouse (click to edit/follow/switch) is postponed; recorded under Deferred with its cost (the terminal's drag-select moves behind Shift).\n\nDesign: doc/design/terminal-renderer.md (Navigation and editing, Show, Deferred). AGENTS.md key paragraph updated.","files":null}]}